.TH GENETREE 1 2000-1月 "gene_stats" "gene_stats"
.SH NAME
gene_stats \- Get the gene alignment and the wildtype baseline of the model.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIgene_stats(\fBtree\fR as <generic> XGBoostGRN, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get the gene alignment and the wildtype baseline of the model.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBtree\fB \fR\- the trained [XGBoostGRN](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.GeneTree.XGBoostGRN) model object.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a list with the slots \fBgene_names\fR, \fBmeans\fR, \fBsds\fR, \fBpopulation\fR,
 \fBhas_context\fR and \fBcontext_fix\fR.
.PP
.SH DETAILS
.PP
the \fBmeans\fR and \fBsds\fR vectors are estimated from the cells that are used
 as the initial states of the fixed point iteration, they define the z-score
 normalization of the perturbation result.
.PP
